repository-code: 'https://github.com/rwth-iat/ModPlant-RTN'
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a resource-task network framework
  that maps branched ISA-88 batch recipes and machine-readable
  modular plant descriptions onto a single constraint-programming
  model. One solve decides branch selection, unit assignment,
  material routing, and timing under a profit objective covering
  makespan, operation cost, energy, and emissions. An independent
  validator re-checks every schedule, which is exported as an
  equipment-assigned BatchML master recipe.
keywords:
  - resource-task network
  - constraint programming
  - batch process scheduling
  - modular production plants
  - ISA-88
  - asset administration shell
